flowchart TD
  A([User manually starts Windows server]) --> B[Scan media & start HTTP API]
  C([Launch Roku app]) --> D{Saved host IP and port?}
  D -- No --> E[Enter host IP and port]
  E --> F[Save settings]
  F --> G[GET /api/health]
  D -- Yes --> G
  B -. Host online .-> G
  G --> H{Reachable?}
  H -- No --> I[Error: Retry or Edit IP]
  I --> G
  H -- Yes --> J[GET /api/media]
  J --> K[Render movie poster grid]
  K --> L[Open movie details]
  L --> M{Play selected?}
  M -- No --> K
  M -- Yes --> N{Direct-play compatible?}
  N -- No --> O[Unsupported format message]
  O --> L
  N -- Yes --> P[Start native Roku Video node HTTP stream]
  P --> Q[Playback HUD]
  Q --> R{User input}
  R -- +15 seconds --> S[Seek clamp position + 15]
  R -- -15 seconds --> T[Seek clamp position - 15]
  R -- Pause / Resume --> U[Toggle playback]
  R -- Audio EQ --> V[Not in MVP: no confirmed DSP]
  S --> Q
  T --> Q
  U --> Q
  V --> Q
  R -- Back / End --> K
